WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.207
Three steps: your form,
your people, your staff.

2
00:00:12.207 --> 00:00:22.020
Your people: paste the roster
your old system exports.

3
00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:30.488
Check what it read
before anything is added.

4
00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:35.459
Four people added.
Nobody retyped a thing.

5
00:00:35.459 --> 00:00:38.953
Then your staff.

6
00:00:38.953 --> 00:00:44.491
Their role, and the title
they sign with.

7
00:00:44.491 --> 00:00:49.833
Send them the link.
It works once per person.
